latticelink2d01.out
Single latticelink2d (elastic latticeslip) at 30 degrees. Node 2 fixed, node 1 loaded with a slip force, a lateral force and a moment giving 1e-6 in each local component: u = F/(k pi d L) with k = e, a1 e, a2 e.
LinearStatic nsteps 1 nmodules 1
errorcheck
domain 2dlattice
OutputManager tstep_all dofman_all element_all
ndofman 2 nelem 1 ncrosssect 1 nmat 1 nbc 2 nic 0 nltf 1 nset 2
node 1 coords 2 0.0 0.0
node 2 coords 2 0.0 0.0
#
latticelink2d 1 nodes 2 1 2 crossSect 1 mat 1 length 0.1 diameter 0.01 dirvector 2 0.8660254037844387 0.5
#
latticecs 1 material 1
latticeslip 1 talpha 0. d 0. e 30.e9 type 0 t0 1.e9 a1 100. a2 100.
BoundaryCondition 1 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 1 2 6 values 3 0. 0. 0. set 1
NodalLoad 2 loadTimeFunction 1 dofs 3 1 2 6 components 3 -4.6307680090e+03 8.2092210289e+03 9.4247779608e+03 set 2
ConstantFunction 1 f(t) 1.
Set 1 nodes 1 2
Set 2 nodes 1 1
#
# Local jump (slip, lateral, rotation) = 1e-6 each; global u = R^T u_local.
#%BEGIN_CHECK% tolerance 1.e-12
#NODE tStep 1 number 1 dof 1 unknown d value 3.6602540378e-07
#NODE tStep 1 number 1 dof 2 unknown d value 1.3660254038e-06
#NODE tStep 1 number 1 dof 6 unknown d value 1.0e-06
#%END_CHECK%
